#: templates/admin/settings.php:71
msgid "Zone / Resource ID"
msgstr "區域／資源 ID"

msgid "Queued"
msgstr "已排入佇列"

msgid "Skipped"
msgstr "已略過"

msgid "Next background attempt: %s"
msgstr "下次背景執行：%s"

msgid "Website alias hostnames"
msgstr "網站別名網域"

msgid "Enter one hostname per line for alternate domains serving the same pages. Add a separate CDN layer when an alias uses a different CDN zone or resource."
msgstr "每行填入一個提供相同頁面的別名主機名稱。別名若使用不同的 CDN Zone 或資源，請另外新增 CDN 層。"

msgid "Inventory page cache generations updated."
msgstr "已更新受庫存影響頁面的快取版本。"

msgid "YS CLOUD supports site-wide clearing only. Inventory changes use page-level clearing."
msgstr "YS CLOUD 僅支援整站清除。庫存變更採用單頁清除。"

msgid "A site alias is assigned to more than one resource at the same CDN provider."
msgstr "同一網站別名被指定至相同 CDN 供應商的多個資源。"

msgid "Add the CDN website hostname to the site aliases before purging this layer."
msgstr "請先將此 CDN 層的網站主機名稱加入網站別名，再執行清除。"

msgid "Cloudflare could not verify every configured alias in this zone. Use a separate CDN layer for aliases in another zone."
msgstr "Cloudflare 無法確認此 Zone 涵蓋全部設定的別名。若別名屬於其他 Zone，請另加 CDN 層。"

msgid "Gcore could not verify every configured alias on this CDN resource."
msgstr "Gcore 無法確認此 CDN 資源涵蓋全部設定的別名。"

msgid "Bunny CDN could not verify every requested hostname on this Pull Zone."
msgstr "Bunny CDN 無法確認此 Pull Zone 涵蓋全部要求清除的主機名稱。"

msgid "The CDN resource could not be verified. Check the configured resource and its read permission."
msgstr "無法驗證 CDN 資源。請檢查資源設定與讀取權限。"

msgid "This CDN purge requires too many requests. Submit smaller batches."
msgstr "本次 CDN 清除需要過多請求。請縮小每批清除範圍。"

msgid "CDN purge stopped after %1$d of %2$d requests. %3$s"
msgstr "CDN 清除在完成 %1$d／%2$d 個請求後停止。%3$s"

msgid "Gcore did not confirm every requested purge path."
msgstr "Gcore 未確認所有要求清除的路徑。"

msgid "Exclusion guide"
msgstr "排除規則指南"

msgid "For a path rule, copy only the path from the public URL, such as %s. Keep the language prefix and any public subdirectory. Leave out the domain, query string, and fragment."
msgstr "設定路徑排除時，只複製公開網址中的路徑，例如 %s。請保留語系前綴及公開子目錄，省略網域、查詢字串和片段。"

msgid "Enter one rule per line in Cache settings → Exclusions."
msgstr "在「快取設定 → 排除」中每行填寫一條規則。"

msgid "Copy the path starting with a slash. Include the language prefix and any public subdirectory. Leave out the domain, query string, and fragment. For %1$s, enter %2$s."
msgstr "複製從斜線開始的路徑，保留語系前綴及公開子目錄，省略網域、查詢字串和片段。網址 %1$s 應填寫為 %2$s。"

msgid "The exact rule %1$s matches %1$s and %2$s. A rule entered with the final slash matches the slash version."
msgstr "精確規則 %1$s 會比對 %1$s 與 %2$s。填寫規則時若保留結尾斜線，便會比對有斜線的版本。"

msgid "Use %1$s to exclude %2$s and its nested pages, such as %3$s."
msgstr "使用 %1$s 可排除 %2$s 及其下的頁面，例如 %3$s。"

msgid "Enter a cookie name prefix. For example, %1$s matches the cookie named %2$s."
msgstr "輸入 Cookie 名稱前綴。例如 %1$s 會比對名為 %2$s 的 Cookie。"

msgid "Enter a part of the User-Agent header. For example, %1$s matches %2$s."
msgstr "輸入 User-Agent 標頭中的一段文字。例如 %1$s 會比對 %2$s。"

msgid "Path lifetime and form caching"
msgstr "路徑時效與表單快取"

msgid "Shorter HTML lifetime by path"
msgstr "依路徑縮短 HTML 快取時效"

msgid "Enter a path and seconds per line. The shortest matching lifetime applies to eligible HTML."
msgstr "每行填入路徑與秒數。符合快取條件的 HTML 會使用命中規則中的最短時效。"

msgid "Public Contact Form 7 paths (Beta)"
msgstr "公開 Contact Form 7 路徑（Beta）"

msgid "Enter one path per line. Eligible public Contact Form 7 forms use local YS CACHE HTML for up to 300 seconds."
msgstr "每行填一個路徑。符合條件的公開 Contact Form 7 可使用 YS CACHE 本機 HTML 快取，最長 300 秒。"

msgid "Forms with visitor-specific data, payments, CAPTCHA, or unsupported fields bypass the cache. WPForms, Fluent Forms and JetFormBuilder remain excluded."
msgstr "含訪客專屬資料、付款、CAPTCHA 或不支援欄位的表單會繞過快取。WPForms、Fluent Forms 與 JetFormBuilder 仍套用排除。"

msgid "Check a front-end cache hit"
msgstr "檢查前台快取命中"

msgid "In a private browser window, open Developer Tools → Network and reload the page twice. Select the main document and check X-YS-Cache in Response Headers. HIT means YS CACHE served HTML. X-FastCGI-Cache describes the server cache separately."
msgstr "在瀏覽器的無痕視窗開啟「開發人員工具 → 網路」，重新載入兩次。選主文件，在「回應標頭」查看 X-YS-Cache。HIT 表示 YS CACHE 已從快取提供 HTML。X-FastCGI-Cache 顯示的是伺服器快取狀態。"

msgid "Load a form separately"
msgstr "獨立載入表單"

msgid "Place the form on a separate page on this site, add its path under Paths, then embed that page in an iframe on the public page. The form loads with its own scripts and visitor state."
msgstr "將表單放在本站的獨立頁面，把該頁網址加到「路徑」，再用 iframe 嵌入公開頁面。表單會獨立載入所需的腳本與訪客狀態。"

msgid "Verify the Nginx server bypass rules for stateful requests before enabling the integration."
msgstr "請先確認 Nginx 在查找快取前會排除有狀態的請求，再啟用整合。"

msgid "Enter the CDN delivery hostname for this asset layer."
msgstr "請輸入此靜態資源層使用的 CDN 主機名稱。"

msgid "Enter a valid CDN delivery hostname."
msgstr "請輸入有效的 CDN 主機名稱。"

msgid "Nginx cache integration is disabled."
msgstr "Nginx 快取整合未啟用。"

msgid "This PHP runtime must have OPcache enabled and allow WordPress to reset it."
msgstr "目前的 PHP 環境必須啟用 OPcache 並允許 WordPress 重設。"

msgid "A verified Nginx purge connection is required."
msgstr "需要已驗證的 Nginx 快取清除連線。"

msgid "Enable and save the Nginx integration before purging."
msgstr "請先啟用並儲存 Nginx 整合，再清除快取。"

msgid "Enable and save the LiteSpeed Cache integration before purging."
msgstr "請先啟用並儲存 LiteSpeed Cache 整合，再清除快取。"

msgid "Save the YS CLOUD connection with its control panel URL, domain ID, and API token."
msgstr "請填寫控制台網址、網域 ID 及 API 權杖，再儲存 YS CLOUD 連線。"

msgid "Enable and save the YS CLOUD integration before purging."
msgstr "請先啟用並儲存 YS CLOUD 整合，再清除快取。"

msgid "Save a CDN layer with API purging enabled, a resource ID, and a valid credential configuration."
msgstr "請先填寫資源 ID 和有效的憑證資料，並啟用和儲存該 CDN 層的 API 清除設定。"

msgid "Nginx Cache (Beta)"
msgstr "Nginx 快取（Beta）"

msgid "Look up an existing Cloudflare zone by its hostname, or enter the zone ID to verify it. Use a Cloudflare API token with access to that zone."
msgstr "可用主機名稱查詢現有的 Cloudflare 網域區域，或輸入 Zone ID 驗證。請使用有權存取該區域的 Cloudflare API 權杖。"

msgid "Look up an existing Bunny CDN Pull Zone by its hostname, or enter the Pull Zone ID to verify it. Use your Bunny account API key."
msgstr "可用主機名稱查詢現有的 Bunny CDN Pull Zone，或輸入 Pull Zone ID 驗證。請使用 Bunny 帳戶 API 金鑰。"

msgid "Look up an existing Gcore CDN resource by its hostname, or enter the resource ID to verify it. Use your Gcore API token."
msgstr "可用主機名稱查詢現有的 Gcore CDN 資源，或輸入資源 ID 驗證。請使用 Gcore API 權杖。"

msgid "CNAME mode rewrites eligible URLs to an existing CDN hostname that already works in DNS. Use a provider layer for API lookup and purging."
msgstr "CNAME 模式將符合條件的網址改寫為 DNS 已可正常解析的 CDN 主機名稱。若要透過 API 查詢與清除，請選擇對應的 CDN 服務商。"

msgid "Verify resource"
msgstr "驗證資源"

msgid "Enter a valid hostname or resource ID and an API credential to look up an existing resource. Asset-only layers also need a hostname."
msgstr "輸入有效主機名稱或資源 ID 及 API 憑證可查詢既有資源。僅供靜態資源使用的 CDN 層也需填寫主機名稱。"

msgid "An existing resource ID and API credential are needed to enable purging. Asset-only layers also need a hostname."
msgstr "啟用清除需填寫既有資源 ID 與 API 憑證。僅供靜態資源使用的 CDN 層也需填寫主機名稱。"

msgid "Purge Nginx cache"
msgstr "清除 Nginx 快取"

msgid "Nginx manages the HTML cache."
msgstr "HTML 快取由 Nginx 管理。"

msgid "This integration requires a host-configured Nginx cache purge connection. An Nginx server header only identifies the web server."
msgstr "此整合需要由主機管理員設定 Nginx 快取清除連線。Nginx 回應標頭只代表網頁伺服器的類型。"

msgid "Use Nginx Cache for HTML and origin purges"
msgstr "使用 Nginx 管理 HTML 快取與來源站清除"

msgid "Connect an existing CDN resource using its delivery hostname or its ID from the provider dashboard. Use an API credential that can read the resource and purge its cache. Resource lookup checks your connection to a resource and its hostname."
msgstr "使用發送內容的主機名稱，或從服務商控制台取得資源 ID，以連接既有 CDN 資源。請使用可以讀取該資源及清除快取的 API 憑證。資源查詢會驗證憑證能否連接該資源，以及主機名稱是否相符。"

msgid "Use a user API token scoped to the existing zone. Include Zone Read for hostname lookup and Cache Purge for clearing. Enter the zone hostname to look up its ID, or enter the Zone ID to verify it."
msgstr "請使用限於該網域區域的使用者 API 權杖。以主機名稱查詢需有 Zone Read 權限，清除快取需有 Cache Purge 權限。輸入主機名稱以查詢 ID，或輸入 Zone ID 驗證。"

msgid "Clear up to %d Nginx page URLs per request."
msgstr "每次請求最多可清除 %d 個 Nginx 頁面網址。"

msgid "Use a valid same-site page URL to clear Nginx Cache."
msgstr "請使用有效的本站頁面網址清除 Nginx 快取。"

msgid "The Nginx listener did not confirm cache clearing."
msgstr "Nginx 本機端點未確認快取已清除。"

